  "updated_at": "2026-01-12T07:51:43.478370+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1162/003355387X00065",
  "reference": "Alesina A. Macroeconomic Policy in a Two-Party System as a Repeated Game. Quarterly Journal of Economics. 1987;102(3):651-678."
